### Page 1 of 3 (scanned page: machine OCR, may contain errors)

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:
Mayor Marian Orr, and City Council
FROM:
Sara Vasquez, Purchasing Manager
DATE:
June 5,2018
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid#E-29-18for furnishing18Police Vehicles with equipment
installed for the Police Department.
We had one (1) bidder respond to this bid, and the bid tab is attached.
The bids were reviewed by Bryan Bell and Lt.Rob Dafoe, and their recommendation is to accept the low
responsive bid from Spradley Barr Motors, Cheyenne, WY with equipment from Recreational Electrical
for a total amount including trade-ins of $797,400.00
: Bupung
022-26-2613-42-43201 (15-18 1% Sales Tax)
```

