Note:  The equipment company took exceptions to some of the items.  The reason we ask for certain items is to
stay consistant with what we have, not only for inventory, but for training purposes.  The City Police
department will consider the "equivalent" in the future, but they need to see what they are proposing.  The
Police department will set up a meeting with Wireless Advanced to see what they are bidding and may change
the specifications for next year.
